@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

<http://cmt#Conference> owl:equivalentClass <http://ekaw#Conference> .

<http://cmt#ConferenceChair> owl:equivalentClass <http://ekaw#Conference> .

<http://cmt#ConferenceMember> owl:equivalentClass <http://ekaw#Conference> .

<http://cmt#Document> owl:equivalentClass <http://ekaw#Document> .

<http://cmt#Paper> owl:equivalentClass <http://ekaw#Paper> .

<http://cmt#Person> owl:equivalentClass <http://ekaw#Person> .

<http://cmt#Review> owl:equivalentClass <http://ekaw#Review> .

<http://cmt#Reviewer> owl:equivalentClass <http://ekaw#Review> .

<http://cmt#assignReviewer> rdfs:subPropertyOf <http://ekaw#hasReviewer> .

<http://cmt#assignedByReviewer> rdfs:subPropertyOf <http://ekaw#hasReviewer> .

<http://cmt#endReview> rdfs:subPropertyOf <http://ekaw#reviewWrittenBy> .

<http://cmt#hasAuthor> rdfs:subPropertyOf <http://ekaw#authorOf> .

<http://cmt#reviewCriteriaEnteredBy> rdfs:subPropertyOf <http://ekaw#reviewWrittenBy> .

<http://cmt#writeReview> rdfs:subPropertyOf <http://ekaw#reviewWrittenBy> .

<http://cmt#writtenBy> owl:equivalentProperty <http://ekaw#writtenBy> .

